  "details": "This only occurs on accounts that have at least 1 Uploaded Private Avatar.\n\n1. Log Out of VRChat, or have the Client ask to re-login at Launch.\n\n2. Log in to your VRChat Account as per usual.\n\n3. Try to find an Avatar in your \"Uploaded\" category. You'll see that the Category no longer exists.\n\n3.5. If you have \"Uploaded\" Avatars pinned to a Quick Menu Wing, it will glitch and show 0 items.\n\nTemporary Workaround:\n\n1. Restart VRChat and ensure you're automatically logged in.\n\nTested on PC. See Build Number specified in this post. Unsure if similar behavior occurs on Android.",
